The graded readers under content/books/ are public-domain works or
retellings of public-domain works:

- `book.aesop-lion-mouse` ("The Lion and the Mouse") is an A1 retelling of
  Aesop's fable as translated by George Fyler Townsend (1867).
- `book.aesop-north-wind-sun` ("The North Wind and the Sun") is an A2
  retelling of the same Townsend translation.
- `book.ohenry-gift-magi` ("The Gift of the Magi") is O. Henry's 1905 short
  story.

The source texts are in the public domain in the United States. The
retellings add no restriction beyond the public-domain source. Full
provenance and source URLs are recorded in THIRD_PARTY.md. The refl compiler
and reader code that processes these texts remain under the GNU Affero
General Public License v3.0 only.
